    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπλήσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπλήρ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cripple by a stroke, disable in
				body</i> or <i>mind</i>: —
				Pass.
			, <i>lose one's senses, become dizzy</i> or
				<i>astounded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1189
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>push off from oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				899b24
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
